  "notes": "Assignment guessed heater/thermostat; these are sensors. Distance levels are firmware thresholds, not documented cm (H5121 45/20, H5129 80/40/20). H5121-H5130 event payloads are not in the split; only LastData.logType is available. H5127 checkStatus semantics and frame byte [24] are not fully named. H5127 uses dynamic SKU H5127_<suffix> from advert. H5129 Li-Sen is a single boolean with firmware-defined detection."
